# MazingiraKenya — local secrets for the scheduled watchers.
#
# 1. Copy this file to scripts/.secrets  (same folder, drop the ".example")
# 2. Paste your Supabase SERVICE_ROLE key after SERVICE_KEY= below.
#    Supabase dashboard -> Project Settings -> API -> Project API keys ->
#    "service_role" (secret).  NOT the anon key.
#
# The service_role key BYPASSES row-level security, so the weekly watchers can
# insert review drafts directly. Treat it like a password:
#   - scripts/.secrets is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#   - It stays on your machine only; Claude reads it locally and never prints it.
#
SERVICE_KEY=paste-your-supabase-service_role-key-here
